description:
Design a 32-bit multiplier block that performs a specific arithmetic operation on the input data. The module takes a 32-bit input and calculates a resultant 32-bit output through a series of bit shifts and additions, effectively implementing a complex calculation that combines various scaled versions of the input. The design primarily uses combinatorial logic to manipulate the input data and generate the output, integrating multiple intermediate signals to achieve the desired arithmetic result.
